    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to bring no 3 Edward Walsh road to the market. Situated on the ever-popular Edward Walsh Road in Togher, this well-proportioned three-bedroom mid-terrace home offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or investors alike. The property is well maintained throughout and provides bright, spacious accommodation with plenty of potential to create a modern family home.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some cosmetic modernisation, it has been well cared for and offers a solid foundation for any purchaser wishing to add their own style and value. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous living room, a spacious kitchen/dining area, three well-sized bedrooms, and two family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys a private rear garden with a concrete shed , while the front offers a lovely lawned garden.\r\n\r\nIdeally located within walking distance of local schools, shops, public transport links, and a host of amenities, the property also enjoys easy access to Cork city centre, Cork University Hospital, and major road networks.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a home in a mature, established residential area with excellent potential to modernise and personalise to suit individual tastes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE PORCH: - \r\nHallway: Laminate flooring and carpet on stairs.\t\n\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM: - 4.1m x 3.3m \r\nThe living room has carpet flooring, one centre light, feature tiled fireplace, built in units and large window to front with blinds and curtains.\r\n\r\nL SHAPED KITCHEN/DINING AREA: - 5.0m x 4.7m \r\nThis L shaped room has lino flooring and has fitted units as well as stainless steel sink & drainer. There is a door to the downstairs bathroom as well as door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM : - \r\nLino floor, 3 piece suite with Triton electric shower.\t\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: - 3.9m x 2.5m \r\nThis large double suite has carpet flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows with curtains overlooking the front of the property. \n\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: - 3.8m x 3.1m \r\nThis double room has carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows overlooking the rear of the property with curtains. This bedroom also has a wardrobe.\n\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: - 3.0m x 2.9m \r\nThis room has carpet flooring, one centre light, one radiator, multiple power points and one window overlooking front  garden with curtains.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM: - \r\n3 piece suite, lino flooring and window overlooking rear garden.\nOutside: Garden to front and garden to rear with concrete shed.\r\n\r\n"
      },
